src/app/assistant.c:369 (route_done) reads d->payload as a const canlin_module_result * without checking the tag that canlin#88 just introduced. It compiles and behaves correctly today because the layout is shared, but it is the same hole the module layer was just closed against: a payload of another shape would be read as a module result. Apply the same guard - check the tag and the size before any field of the body is read. Found by the 2026-11-14 work on k88.

